      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Stroll the Royal Route where Krakowskie Przedmieście and Nowy Świat blend neoclassical facades with modern cafés, creating a living promenade.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
